<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major></Major>
    <Description>this macro is a movement technique used in fights to avoid enemie bullets. Simply bind this macro tho your desired hotkey. Make sure that in your Apex settings "scroll wheel up" is "move forward" and "scroll wheel down" is "jump". I suggest to choose a keybind, that you dont use ingame. I recocmend to practice in "shooting range" first before playing "pubs" or "ranked".
Enjoy!</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>0</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
